5,0,1,talk,Minato,,"Hello everyone! I'm a bit nervous, but I'm really excited to play with you all. I hope we can all be friends while we figure this out. Does anyone have a plan for how we should start?","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Benjamin,,A pleasure to meet you all. I believe a calm and observant start is most prudent. Let us maintain a polite discourse and see whose mask begins to slip as the pressure mounts. Does that sound agreeable?,"{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Servas,,"It is a pleasure to be in such fine company. Benjamin, your call for composure is wise. Let us treat this as a journey of discovery, where patience and kindness guide us toward the truth. I am happy to listen.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,May,,"I'm with you all on the politeness, but let's not be *too* quiet! A little bit of excitement makes it more fun, don't you think? I'll be watching everyone's expressions very closely. Hehe!","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Takumi,,"I'm ready! I don't care about masks or being polite—I just want to find the wolf and protect everyone. Let's stop talking about being ""calm"" and actually start looking for clues!","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Minato,,"@Takumi, you're so energetic! It's a bit scary, but I think it's great that you want to protect us. Maybe we can all share what we're thinking? I want to learn how to find clues too!","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Takumi, your passion is commendable, though clues are currently a luxury we do not possess. For now, the only evidence we have is the way each of you speaks. Let us observe the patterns of our conversation.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Servas,,"@Takumi, your spirit is like a bright flame, and it is wonderful to see such vitality. However, remember that the most profound truths often reveal themselves in the quiet moments between the words. Let us be patient.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,May,,"@Servas, you're so poetic! But @Takumi is right that we need a goal. Since we're just chatting, why don't we see who's trying too hard to be the ""voice of reason""? That's always a bit suspicious, isn't it?","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Servas"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Takumi,,"@May, now you're talking! @Benjamin and @Servas are acting way too fancy and calm. It feels like they're just trying to hide something behind those big words. I'm not going to let the wolf trick us!","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""May"",""Benjamin"",""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Minato,,"@Takumi, @May, please don't fight! I think Benjamin and Servas are just being kind. But I'm curious too... what does ""hiding something"" look like? I want to understand how to tell if someone is lying.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""May"",""Benjamin"",""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Benjamin,,"@Minato, a lie often wears the garment of perfection. It is the subtle contradiction, the over-explanation, or the sudden shift in tone that betrays the wolf. We must listen for the gaps in the narrative.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Servas,,"@Minato, a lie is often a heavy burden to carry, and eventually, the weight causes the speaker to stumble. Do not fear the unknown; simply listen with an open heart and a clear mind. The truth has its own melody.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,May,,"@Benjamin, @Servas, you two are practically singing to us! It's almost too perfect. I love the drama, but I'm starting to wonder if this ""melody"" is just a distraction to keep us from noticing something. Hehe!","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Benjamin"",""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Takumi,,"@May, exactly! They're just talking in circles to make us feel confused. @Benjamin, @Servas, stop with the riddles! If you're really humans, just talk normally. I'm keeping my eyes on both of you!","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""May"",""Benjamin"",""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Minato,,I think everyone is just trying their best to help. It's a bit sad that we're already suspicious of each other. Let's all try to be gentle tonight. I'm looking forward to tomorrow!,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
21,0,4,pass,Minato,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
22,0,4,talk,Benjamin,,"It has been a most illuminating first day. While some prefer the fire of suspicion, I shall remain a student of your patterns. I wish you all a peaceful night; may the shadows be revealing.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
23,0,4,pass,Benjamin,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
24,0,4,talk,Servas,,It has been a joy to share this first day with you all. Let us embrace the night with hope and a spirit of unity. I wish you all a restful sleep and a bright tomorrow.,"{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
25,0,4,pass,Servas,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
26,0,4,talk,May,,"I've had a blast getting to know you all today! Let's see if the night brings any juicy secrets to the surface. Sweet dreams, everyone—try not to let the wolf under your bed! Hehe!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
27,0,4,pass,May,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
28,0,4,talk,Takumi,,"I'm not going to sleep until I've thought through everything! I don't trust those fancy speeches one bit. I'll be ready to pounce on the wolf tomorrow morning. Goodnight, everyone!","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
29,0,4,pass,Takumi,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
