36,1,1,talk,Minato,,"Good morning, everyone! I hope you all had sweet dreams. I'm a little nervous about today, but I'm curious... did the Seer find anything helpful? I hope we can still be kind to each other while we talk.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"Good morning, Minato. Your optimism is a refreshing start to the day. As for the Seer, it is a delicate matter of timing; to speak too soon is to invite the wolf's appetite, yet silence can be a waste.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,1,talk,Servas,,"Good morning to you all. It is a blessing to see your faces again. Let us approach this day with a steady heart; whether the Seer speaks now or later, the truth will find its way to the light.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,1,talk,May,,"Good morning! You two are still in ""poetry mode,"" I see. Hehe! @Minato, I'm curious too. If the Seer found a wolf, wouldn't it be a little mean to keep it a secret? Who's feeling brave enough to share?","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,1,talk,Takumi,,"@May, you're right! If the Seer knows who the wolf is, they should just say it so we can get rid of them! @Benjamin, @Servas, stop stalling with your ""delicate timing"" and tell us if you know something!","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""May"",""Benjamin"",""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,2,talk,Minato,,"@Takumi, please don't be so angry! I think the Seer might be scared of being attacked if they tell us too early. Maybe we should wait a little bit? I don't want anyone to get hurt.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Takumi, your eagerness to protect us is admirable, but haste is the wolf's greatest ally. If I were to reveal myself as the Seer now, I would merely be offering the predator a convenient target for tonight.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,2,talk,Servas,,"@Takumi, your passion is a gift, but let us not mistake speed for progress. A seed must grow in its own time before it blooms. Let us give the Seer the space to decide when it is safest to speak.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,2,talk,May,,"@Benjamin, wait, did you just basically admit you're the Seer? Or are you just playing a very clever game of ""what if""? You're teasing us! Hehe, come on, give us a real hint! Are you the one with the vision?","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Benjamin, stop playing games! You just said ""If I were to reveal myself,"" which is exactly what a liar does to sound smart. Either you're the Seer and you're being stubborn, or you're the wolf trying to trick us! Just say it!","{""words"":42,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,3,talk,Minato,,"@Benjamin, @Takumi, please stop arguing! It makes my heart hurt to see you both so upset. @Benjamin, if you are the Seer, please be safe. I just want us all to get along and find the wolf together.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Benjamin"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,"@Takumi, your insistence on a confession is quite the spectacle. Since you are so desperate for clarity, I shall be candid: I am indeed the Seer. I can confirm that Takumi is human, though his temperament is certainly... spirited.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,3,talk,Servas,,"@Benjamin, your courage in stepping forward is a noble act for the sake of our community. @Takumi, you see? The truth has emerged through your persistence. Let us now cherish this knowledge and protect our Seer.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Benjamin"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,3,talk,May,,"@Benjamin, finally! I knew you couldn't resist the spotlight for too long. Hehe! So @Takumi is officially a good boy? That's a relief, though I'm sure he's still going to be a handful! Who else did you look at, or is that a secret?","{""words"":44,""mentions"":[""Benjamin"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,3,talk,Takumi,,"@Benjamin, don't think that just because you ""cleared"" me, I'm suddenly on your side! You waited until I backed you into a corner to say it. If you're really the Seer, keep digging and find the wolf! Who's next on your list?","{""words"":42,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,1,4,talk,Minato,,"@Benjamin, thank you for being so brave and telling us! I'm really happy that @Takumi is human. I hope we can all trust each other now and be a team. Who should we vote for today?","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Benjamin"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,"@Minato, trust is a fragile thing, but a necessary bridge. Since Takumi is confirmed human, we have a reliable anchor. However, we must remain vigilant; the wolf may now attempt to mimic our unity to blend in. Who seems most unnatural to you?","{""words"":43,""mentions"":[""Minato"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,1,4,talk,Servas,,"@Minato, your desire for unity is a beautiful thing. While we must be cautious, let us not let suspicion steal our peace. I believe we should trust Benjamin's guidance for now and avoid a rash decision.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Minato"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,1,4,talk,May,,"@Servas, you're always so peaceful, but ""avoiding a rash decision"" is just a fancy way of saying we might not vote. I'm not sure about that! If we don't act, the wolf just gets a free meal tonight. Who's your target, @Takumi?","{""words"":42,""mentions"":[""Servas"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
55,1,4,talk,Takumi,,"@May, I'm not just guessing! @Benjamin says I'm human, but that doesn't mean he's not lying to make me trust him. Still, @Servas is the one who's been too quiet and supportive. I'm voting for Servas!","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""May"",""Benjamin"",""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
