69,2,1,talk,Minato,,Oh no... Servas is gone. I feel so sad because he was always so kind to us. And Benjamin was attacked too! This is so scary. Does this mean the wolf is really among us? I'm shaking a little...,"{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Servas"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,2,1,talk,May,,"It's a total tragedy about Servas, but look at the bright side—the wolf clearly hates Benjamin! Getting attacked right after claiming Seer is a huge tell. @Benjamin, you're still with us, right? Please tell us what you saw!","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Servas"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,2,1,talk,Takumi,,"@Benjamin, you're still alive, so stop talking in riddles and give us the facts! If you're the Seer, you better have found the wolf last night. Who is it? Tell us right now so we can end this!","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,2,2,talk,Minato,,"@Takumi, please don't be so mean to Benjamin! He's already been attacked, so he must be really scared. @Benjamin, are you okay? Please tell us what you found, but only if you feel safe doing it. I'm so worried about us.","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,2,2,talk,May,,"@Minato, you're such a sweetheart, but let's focus! @Benjamin, the wolf tried to take you out, which basically confirms you're the Seer. No more teasing—who did you divine last night? Give us a name so we can finish this! Hehe!","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Minato"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,2,2,talk,Takumi,,"@May, stop laughing! This isn't a game anymore! @Benjamin, you're the only one who can end this right now. If you're still alive, you have the answer. Stop being stubborn and tell us who the wolf is!","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""May"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,2,3,talk,Minato,,"@Takumi, @May, please be patient! Benjamin is the only one who can help us, but if we pressure him too much, he might get even more scared. @Benjamin, we are all listening. Please tell us what you found so we can be safe together.","{""words"":44,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""May"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,2,3,talk,May,,"@Minato, I'm being patient, but we're running out of time! @Benjamin, you've had your dramatic moment and you've survived an attack. Now it's time to be the hero. Who is the wolf? Don't keep us in suspense! Hehe!","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Minato"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,2,3,talk,Takumi,,"@Benjamin, enough with the silence! You're the only one who can see through the lies. If you don't tell us who the wolf is right now, you're just letting the wolf win! Speak up and save us!","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,2,4,talk,Minato,,"I'm really scared that Benjamin isn't answering... maybe he's too hurt or too frightened to speak? @May, @Takumi, please, let's just be gentle with him. Benjamin, we really need your help, but we'll wait for you. Please tell us.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Benjamin"",""May"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,2,4,talk,May,,"Wait, is he actually ignoring us? That's not very heroic, Benjamin! Hehe. @Minato, I think he's just playing hard to get with the truth. @Benjamin, if you're still there, speak up or we're just guessing! This is getting way too quiet.","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[""Benjamin"",""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
80,2,4,talk,Takumi,,"@Benjamin, this is unbelievable! You're just going to stay silent while we're all in danger? If you're the Seer, you're being a coward! If you're the wolf, you're just waiting for us to kill each other! I'm done waiting!","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
